          ]
        },
        "202510005": {
          "id": 202510005,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "System",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "Your friend is typing...",
          "next": [
            202510006,
            202510007
          ]
        },
        "202510006": {
          "id": 202510006,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "What's up? Hesitation's not really your style.",
          "next": [
            202510008
          ]
        },
        "202510007": {
          "id": 202510007,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "Deep in thought?",
          "next": [
            202510008
          ]
        },
        "202510008": {
          "id": 202510008,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1503,
          "text": "I received a piece of art.",
          "next": [
            202510009
          ]
        },
        "202510009": {
          "id": 202510009,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1503,
          "text": "A while back, a street portrait artist asked me to be their model and painted a piece titled \"Pearl.\"",
          "next": [
            202510010
          ]
        },
        "202510010": {
          "id": 202510010,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1503,
          "text": "The negative space in this piece is incredibly striking.",
          "next": [
            202510011
          ]
        },
        "202510011": {
          "id": 202510011,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1503,
          "text": "Because all they did was slash a single cut across the paper with a knife.",
          "next": [
            202510012
          ]
        },
        "202510012": {
          "id": 202510012,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1503,
          "text": "Reflection: what's the connection between the artwork and me...",
          "next": [
            202510013,
            202510016
          ]
        },
        "202510013": {
          "id": 202510013,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "Art is still way too hard to understand.",
          "next": [
            202510014
          ]
        },
        "202510014": {
          "id": 202510014,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "PlayerAuto",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "A single cut... honestly, it'd work great as a tissue dispenser slot. Maybe what they meant was...",
          "next": [
            202510015
          ]
        },
        "202510015": {
          "id": 202510015,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "PlayerAuto",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "\"Pearl, pull me?\"",
          "next": [
            202510019
          ]
        },
        "202510016": {
          "id": 202510016,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "Art is way too easy to understand now.",
          "next": [
            202510017
          ]
        },
        "202510017": {
          "id": 202510017,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "PlayerAuto",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "A cut that tears through space, doesn't it kinda look like an open wallet?",
          "next": [
            202510018
          ]
        },
        "202510018": {
          "id": 202510018,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "PlayerAuto",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "Stick your hand in, and you'll definitely pull something out...",
          "next": [
            202510019
          ]
        },
        "202510019": {
          "id": 202510019,
          "type": "Sticker",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1503,
          "next": [
            202510020
          ]
        },
        "202510020": {
          "id": 202510020,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1503,
          "text": "Conjecture: turns out it's a mystery box merchant in disguise. No wonder they stopped me on the street.",
          "next": [
            202510021
          ]
        },
        "202510021": {
          "id": 202510021,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1503,
          "text": "But your interpretation is really interesting.",
          "next": [
            202510022
          ]
        },
        "202510022": {
          "id": 202510022,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1503,
          "text": "Art: the deconstruction of life.",
          "next": [
            202510023
          ]
        },
        "202510023": {
          "id": 202510023,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1503,
          "text": "Interpreting art: also means deconstructing art.",
          "next": [
            202510024
          ]
        },
        "202510024": {
          "id": 202510024,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1503,
          "text": "But: does deconstructing art get you an answer?",
          "next": [
            202510025
          ]
        },
        "202510025": {
          "id": 202510025,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1503,
          "text": "Maybe not. Thus: you have to deconstruct the deconstruction of art.",
          "next": [
            202510026,
            202510027
          ]
        },
        "202510026": {
          "id": 202510026,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "What did I just trigger? Brain, shut up, shut up!",
          "next": [
            202510028
          ]
        },
        "202510027": {
          "id": 202510027,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "Oh no. What have I done, Pearl glitched.",
          "next": [
            202510028
          ]
        },
        "202510028": {
          "id": 202510028,
          "type": "Sticker",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1503,
          "next": [
            202510029
          ]
        },
        "202510029": {
          "id": 202510029,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1503,
          "text": "Don't worry. I just got inspired by you and took a little abstract detour.",
          "next": [
            202510030
          ]
        },
        "202510030": {
          "id": 202510030,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1503,
          "text": "But I actually do have a brand new understanding of that piece now...",
          "next": [
            202510031
          ]
        },
        "202510031": {
          "id": 202510031,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1503,
          "text": "It might be saying:",
          "next": [
            202510032
          ]
        },
        "202510032": {
          "id": 202510032,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1503,
          "text": "\"Open the shell, I am the pearl.\"",
          "next": [
            202510033
          ]
        },
        "202510033": {
          "id": 202510033,
          "type": "Sticker",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1503,
